      "beat_id": "B02STATE",
      "act": "SHOW",
      "heading": "State and observation",
      "narration_text": "The state is the full situation inside the environment. The observation is what the agent actually gets to see. In CartPole, that's four numbers: the cart's position and speed, and the pole's angle and how fast it's tipping. In other environments, the agent may see only part of the state.",
      "engine": "kokoro",
